WEBVTT

00:00:11.080 --> 00:00:15.620
So, he stole the victim's money and other valuables.

00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:17.100
And...

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:19.950
his internal organs.

00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:23.620
Damn you, Lantern. 
I swear, even if it's the last thing I do,

00:00:23.990 --> 00:00:26.630
I will catch you and restore the dignity of CCG.

00:01:09.360 --> 00:01:10.960
This fucking blows...

00:01:32.360 --> 00:01:36.690
If you substitute this with what we got from that equation...

00:01:39.570 --> 00:01:42.540
Fura, are you aware of what period this is?

00:01:43.850 --> 00:01:46.530
Will Sasada Aki be absent again?

00:01:47.110 --> 00:01:48.000
How would I know?

00:01:48.430 --> 00:01:49.670
She's probably playing hooky.

00:01:54.390 --> 00:01:58.820
When solving this equation try to avoid using factors.

00:01:59.490 --> 00:02:03.610
Six plus sigma <i>k</i> equals one so <i>n</i> minus one is...

00:02:03.610 --> 00:02:05.180
Hey, Taishi...

00:02:05.650 --> 00:02:07.910
Why did you quit playing baseball?

00:02:08.460 --> 00:02:10.690
Didn't you like it?

00:02:11.930 --> 00:02:13.190
Aki...

00:02:16.710 --> 00:02:19.240
You don't have a textbook, right?

00:02:20.960 --> 00:02:23.180
Arima, was it?

00:02:24.660 --> 00:02:26.250
Don't you need it?

00:02:27.210 --> 00:02:30.380
I'll be fine without it. 
I already memorized all the formulas.

00:02:30.380 --> 00:02:31.370
You can have it.

00:02:33.030 --> 00:02:34.440
I don't need it.

00:02:34.440 --> 00:02:35.420
Are you sure?

00:02:35.890 --> 00:02:38.960
Fura-kun, you rarely come to school.

00:02:38.960 --> 00:02:40.930
And I doubt you're smart enough to do it without.

00:02:40.930 --> 00:02:43.460
So you should probably just take it.

00:02:44.340 --> 00:02:45.390
What'd you say, asshole!?

00:02:46.170 --> 00:02:47.140
Fura!

00:02:50.290 --> 00:02:51.340
Get out.

00:02:51.340 --> 00:02:53.570
You're disturbing those who are serious about studying.

00:03:01.020 --> 00:03:03.850
<i>Well I never cared about studying anyway.</i>

00:03:08.710 --> 00:03:10.280
I've got it! I've got it!

00:03:10.280 --> 00:03:12.710
<i>What if I hadn't quit playing baseball?</i>

00:03:13.820 --> 00:03:16.340
<i>Would things have turned out differently?</i>

00:03:20.860 --> 00:03:22.840
You on the motorcycles! Pull over!

00:03:23.350 --> 00:03:25.250
Sure thing, dipshits!

00:03:25.250 --> 00:03:27.100
Aki, hang on tight!

00:03:37.360 --> 00:03:38.070
Aki!?

00:03:38.500 --> 00:03:42.070
What idiots... Are they trying to get themselves killed?

00:03:47.790 --> 00:03:50.580
Let's go for another run later.

00:03:50.580 --> 00:03:53.000
Ryou, Aki-chan, you guys want anything?

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:53.790
Soda.

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:53.790
Soda.

00:03:53.790 --> 00:03:55.660
You two sure get along.

00:03:55.660 --> 00:03:57.600
All right, the last one there pays!

00:03:57.600 --> 00:03:59.800
Why you, wait right there!

00:03:58.160 --> 00:03:59.800
Run for it!

00:04:04.350 --> 00:04:08.310
Aki, what's Taishi been up to lately?

00:04:08.310 --> 00:04:09.680
I don't know.

00:04:09.680 --> 00:04:12.090
I think he's been going to class.

00:04:13.650 --> 00:04:16.510
That's odd. He's barely been on campus since he quit baseball.

00:04:16.510 --> 00:04:18.940
Maybe he settled down with a girl or something.

00:04:18.940 --> 00:04:19.730
Huh?

00:04:20.070 --> 00:04:22.440
But then, he can't ever commit to anything.

00:04:22.440 --> 00:04:23.820
First he quits playing baseball.

00:04:23.820 --> 00:04:25.600
Then he starts up our gang...

00:04:25.600 --> 00:04:26.870
But then he quits that too.

00:04:27.600 --> 00:04:29.980
He had talent, too.

00:04:29.980 --> 00:04:31.120
He still does!

00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:35.710
The three of us used to be inseparable.

00:04:37.800 --> 00:04:42.340
Can't we go back to how we were?

00:04:45.340 --> 00:04:47.680
Not any more, unfortunately.

00:04:49.740 --> 00:04:50.940
You're probably right...

00:04:54.450 --> 00:04:57.100
This is gonna be awkward.

00:05:01.230 --> 00:05:02.780
You lost. Cough it up!

00:05:03.520 --> 00:05:04.990
What's wrong?

00:05:06.150 --> 00:05:07.980
No, it's nothing.

00:05:07.980 --> 00:05:10.450
Huh? What's up with you?

00:05:12.660 --> 00:05:15.080
M-My hand!

00:05:16.830 --> 00:05:20.010
Seriously, what's taking them so long?

00:05:21.190 --> 00:05:21.840
Huh?

00:05:22.230 --> 00:05:23.210
Hey!

00:05:23.510 --> 00:05:25.090
About time you got back!

00:05:30.830 --> 00:05:32.600
Who the hell... are you!?

00:05:40.680 --> 00:05:41.940
Hey, you guys!

00:05:41.940 --> 00:05:42.940
Run!

00:05:42.940 --> 00:05:44.740
Move your ass! C'mon!

00:05:45.450 --> 00:05:46.700
Are the cops still after you?

00:05:46.700 --> 00:05:47.660
No!

00:05:47.660 --> 00:05:49.530
It's something much worse!

00:05:53.330 --> 00:05:54.120
Taishi!

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:55.620
You bastard!

00:05:56.100 --> 00:05:58.080
What's with the fucking creeper mask!?

00:05:59.540 --> 00:06:02.210
Halloween was months ago!

00:06:06.330 --> 00:06:10.140
Eat dirt, you pumpkin-headed freak!

00:06:10.140 --> 00:06:11.970
Stop it, Taishi!

00:06:11.970 --> 00:06:13.390
Let's just get out of here!

00:06:22.050 --> 00:06:24.190
What the hell is that!?

00:06:33.120 --> 00:06:34.080
Aki!

00:06:44.300 --> 00:06:45.450
Ryou...

00:06:49.550 --> 00:06:55.820
We... should've just kept... playing baseball together.

00:06:57.070 --> 00:06:57.910
I...

00:06:57.910 --> 00:06:58.920
Ryou!

00:07:02.470 --> 00:07:03.920
I'm sorry.

00:07:10.590 --> 00:07:11.720
Ryou...

00:07:23.710 --> 00:07:25.520
You fucking bastard!

00:07:25.520 --> 00:07:26.560
Fura-kun.

00:07:30.510 --> 00:07:31.860
You'll die.

00:07:31.860 --> 00:07:32.470
Arima?

00:07:33.220 --> 00:07:34.220
Stay back!

00:07:56.360 --> 00:07:58.870
No way I could keep up with that.

00:08:02.870 --> 00:08:04.540
Take her to the hospital immediately!

00:08:08.800 --> 00:08:11.800
Can I talk to you for a second?

00:08:12.470 --> 00:08:14.800
CCG?

00:08:16.670 --> 00:08:20.930
<i>Arima... Even after everything that just happened...</i>

00:08:22.100 --> 00:08:25.310
See you, Fura-kun. I'll see you at school tomorrow.

00:08:26.330 --> 00:08:28.570
<i>...he left as if he was going home from a club meeting;</i>

00:08:29.620 --> 00:08:32.070
<i>completely unfazed.</i>

00:08:37.280 --> 00:08:38.580
Aki...

00:08:54.180 --> 00:08:55.660
Ryou...

00:08:55.660 --> 00:08:58.930
I can't let it end like this!

00:09:09.580 --> 00:09:10.690
Hey!

00:09:11.540 --> 00:09:15.170
What do you know about that monster?

00:09:16.990 --> 00:09:18.550
Just tell me!

00:09:19.320 --> 00:09:22.290
His name is Lantern. He's a ghoul.

00:09:22.290 --> 00:09:23.120
Ghoul?

00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:26.750
Looking no different than humans,
they live amongst us unnoticed.

00:09:26.750 --> 00:09:29.260
Strange beings that devour humans.

00:09:29.920 --> 00:09:32.290
The natural enemy of mankind.

00:09:32.290 --> 00:09:33.510
Flesh-eating monsters.

00:09:34.670 --> 00:09:35.880
Ghouls.

00:09:38.200 --> 00:09:42.520
Arima, if you're going after that 
pumpkin head, I'm going with you!

00:09:43.230 --> 00:09:45.800
No thanks. You'd just slow me down.

00:09:45.800 --> 00:09:47.060
You—

00:09:48.610 --> 00:09:49.610
I'm...

00:09:52.510 --> 00:09:56.610
pissed at myself for not being able to do anything back there!

00:09:58.380 --> 00:10:01.500
I'm going to avenge them.

00:10:01.500 --> 00:10:04.290
I don't give a damn if you 
help or not, but I'm gonna do it!

00:10:07.150 --> 00:10:08.570
All right.

00:10:11.570 --> 00:10:13.800
So, how do we find this Lantern?

00:10:14.350 --> 00:10:17.390
We kill them off one by one until we find him.

00:10:17.390 --> 00:10:19.830
Just how many ghouls are out there!?

00:10:20.560 --> 00:10:21.470
A lot.

00:10:21.940 --> 00:10:24.820
Especially here in the 13th Ward.

00:10:26.530 --> 00:10:28.030
I know, right?

00:10:41.440 --> 00:10:44.030
<i>I'm already craving another meal...</i>

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:50.580
It's dangerous

00:10:50.880 --> 00:10:52.960
to be wandering alleys at night, you know.

00:11:02.720 --> 00:11:06.680
It's like you're begging me to eat you.

00:11:19.000 --> 00:11:19.610
Arima!

00:11:20.110 --> 00:11:21.610
Don't worry, she's just asleep.

00:11:21.940 --> 00:11:24.530
Don't you mean she fainted?

00:11:24.530 --> 00:11:26.120
Fura-kun, be careful.

00:11:26.900 --> 00:11:30.330
He's pretty strong.

00:11:33.940 --> 00:11:35.040
Here he comes.

00:11:41.430 --> 00:11:44.400
Damn it! You son of a bitch!

00:11:45.940 --> 00:11:46.930
The hell you doing!?

00:11:47.320 --> 00:11:48.990
Which sounds like more fun,

00:11:48.990 --> 00:11:51.440
a kick to the face or being impaled by kagune?

00:11:52.110 --> 00:11:54.460
Normal weapons won't work against a ghoul.

00:11:59.280 --> 00:12:04.240
<i>If that's true, then how are you supposed to fight them?</i>

00:12:07.030 --> 00:12:08.370
It's Yukimura's turn.

00:12:18.940 --> 00:12:20.420
That's—

00:12:20.420 --> 00:12:22.010
Don't tell me this kid is actually...

00:12:31.820 --> 00:12:34.650
How does a little brat like you

00:12:35.230 --> 00:12:37.650
have one of the ghoul investigators' weapons?

00:12:42.550 --> 00:12:44.120
The answer is simple.

00:12:44.120 --> 00:12:47.340
Because I am a ghoul investigator.

00:12:48.490 --> 00:12:51.510
A runt like you, an investigator?

00:12:51.510 --> 00:12:52.990
Impossible.

00:13:12.350 --> 00:13:13.800
Arima.

00:13:13.800 --> 00:13:17.060
Yep, he was about as strong as I thought.

00:13:17.860 --> 00:13:19.570
Nice pitching.

00:13:24.040 --> 00:13:25.660
Arima!

00:13:26.160 --> 00:13:29.410
I did order you to do an undercover investigation,

00:13:29.410 --> 00:13:31.840
but that doesn't mean you have permission to act on your own.

00:13:31.840 --> 00:13:32.910
Marude-san,

00:13:33.270 --> 00:13:36.100
I took down a ghoul, didn't I?

00:13:36.100 --> 00:13:39.380
You only think with hindsight and talk too much!

00:13:39.380 --> 00:13:41.550
One day, it'll get you killed. In fact, die now!

00:13:42.520 --> 00:13:43.550
What's more,

00:13:43.870 --> 00:13:47.020
you involved a civilian.

00:13:47.020 --> 00:13:48.500
And not just one, but two.

00:13:48.500 --> 00:13:49.300
Two?

00:13:53.830 --> 00:13:56.310
You know how to take care of this, right?

00:13:57.440 --> 00:13:58.340
Yes.

00:14:00.360 --> 00:14:02.820
What is it you want to talk about?

00:14:03.560 --> 00:14:06.290
Fura-kun, I'm dropping out.

00:14:06.290 --> 00:14:07.480
Huh?

00:14:07.480 --> 00:14:10.230
Now that you and Minami-san know my identity,

00:14:10.230 --> 00:14:12.330
trying to remain undercover would be pointless.

00:14:12.700 --> 00:14:15.100
What do you mean by that?

00:14:16.360 --> 00:14:19.970
I move from place to place hunting ghouls.

00:14:20.910 --> 00:14:24.840
It's been a long time since I spoke with someone my age.

00:14:25.300 --> 00:14:28.680
Living an ordinary school life was fun while it lasted.

00:14:29.890 --> 00:14:30.720
Thank you.

00:14:32.470 --> 00:14:34.950
What kind of life is that?

00:14:36.180 --> 00:14:38.540
It's fine as long as nobody finds out, right?

00:14:38.540 --> 00:14:42.310
I'm not going to reveal your identity to anyone! I swear!

00:14:44.360 --> 00:14:46.570
Give normal life another chance!

00:14:49.870 --> 00:14:53.080
Maybe I should ask my boss to let me continue.

00:14:53.080 --> 00:14:54.620
Really?

00:14:54.620 --> 00:14:56.340
Yes, besides...

00:14:56.340 --> 00:14:58.330
I've still got work to do here.

00:14:58.750 --> 00:15:00.330
Lantern.

00:15:00.330 --> 00:15:02.630
He was my target from the beginning.

00:15:03.200 --> 00:15:05.340
And you still want to get revenge, right?

00:15:07.370 --> 00:15:10.090
Will you lend me your help, Taishi?

00:15:12.200 --> 00:15:13.250
You bet!

00:15:14.700 --> 00:15:16.840
You'll be perfect as bait.

00:15:16.840 --> 00:15:19.660
That was uncalled for.

00:15:19.660 --> 00:15:20.690
Me too!

00:15:22.910 --> 00:15:24.610
I'd like to help too!

00:15:29.220 --> 00:15:30.610
Aki.

00:15:34.620 --> 00:15:35.680
Yo.

00:15:35.680 --> 00:15:37.120
You're here again.

00:15:37.600 --> 00:15:39.170
Got a problem with that?

00:15:39.170 --> 00:15:43.590
If a delinquent like you comes here, people will think I'm one as well.

00:15:43.590 --> 00:15:45.380
Dummy. You are a delinquent.

00:15:47.060 --> 00:15:48.400
What were you looking at?

00:15:52.200 --> 00:15:54.520
Just the scenery outside the window.

00:15:54.520 --> 00:15:55.440
I see.

00:15:55.840 --> 00:15:59.450
But, I can't see anything out of my right eye.

00:15:59.970 --> 00:16:02.820
It's kind of hard to keep a sense of direction.

00:16:03.660 --> 00:16:06.120
Maybe this is my punishment

00:16:06.120 --> 00:16:07.900
for just fooling around with friends

00:16:08.220 --> 00:16:09.900
and not taking things seriously.

00:16:11.450 --> 00:16:12.910
That's why...

00:16:13.820 --> 00:16:16.120
my right eye, and Ryou...

00:16:16.120 --> 00:16:18.910
were taken away from me...

00:16:19.950 --> 00:16:21.910
by that hellish thing.

00:16:24.620 --> 00:16:27.960
<i>After that, Arima, Minami, and I</i>

00:16:28.370 --> 00:16:33.880
<i>worked together to kill ghoul after ghoul in the 13th Ward.</i>

00:16:36.360 --> 00:16:38.680
<i>Minami was our information gatherer,</i>

00:16:39.780 --> 00:16:41.520
<i>I was the bait,</i>

00:16:41.520 --> 00:16:43.640
<i>and Arima finished them off.</i>

00:16:44.590 --> 00:16:49.160
<i>Little by little, we became a really good team.</i>

00:16:50.050 --> 00:16:54.700
<i>But, we still had no lead on Lantern.</i>

00:16:59.380 --> 00:17:00.310
Ah!

00:17:02.190 --> 00:17:03.210
There you are!

00:17:05.080 --> 00:17:07.540
I was thinking we might find something here at school.

00:17:07.540 --> 00:17:11.670
I asked around a bit and found a few rumors that might be related to ghouls.

00:17:11.670 --> 00:17:15.920
So, here's a write-up of everything that I've found so far.

00:17:15.920 --> 00:17:17.680
That's amazing.

00:17:17.680 --> 00:17:19.920
That's an honor student for you.

00:17:20.630 --> 00:17:25.150
This rumor about someone lurking about a prefab house in this construction area

00:17:25.150 --> 00:17:27.240
seems the most credible.

00:17:27.240 --> 00:17:29.950
I also marked the other rumors that had reliable leads.

00:17:29.950 --> 00:17:31.380
You can check them out.

00:17:31.380 --> 00:17:33.190
Wow, thank you!

00:17:33.500 --> 00:17:37.200
All right! First, we'll check the construction area house!

00:17:37.900 --> 00:17:39.180
Thanks for the information.

00:17:39.180 --> 00:17:42.200
We can handle the rest, 
so there's no need for you to come.

00:17:42.200 --> 00:17:45.110
Hey, Arima! Did you really have to say it like that?

00:17:46.320 --> 00:17:47.210
Um...

00:17:48.160 --> 00:17:49.540
Is it that I'm not strong enough?

00:17:50.000 --> 00:17:52.710
I want to help more, if I can.

00:17:53.080 --> 00:17:56.720
No. It's too risky to bring you.

00:17:57.580 --> 00:18:01.770
Taishi, we're going to visit that house after school, so be prepared.

00:18:01.770 --> 00:18:03.720
O-Okay...

00:18:06.220 --> 00:18:09.960
The information you give us is 
always really helpful, you know.

00:18:10.600 --> 00:18:11.350
Really?

00:18:11.350 --> 00:18:12.360
You bet!

00:18:12.730 --> 00:18:13.900
I'm glad.

00:18:16.310 --> 00:18:18.110
Hey, Fura-kun.

00:18:18.820 --> 00:18:21.420
Arima-kun is a bit strange, isn't he?

00:18:21.420 --> 00:18:23.810
Yeah, you're right about that.

00:18:23.810 --> 00:18:25.620
Even his name is strange.

00:18:26.170 --> 00:18:27.960
Arima Kishou.

00:18:28.540 --> 00:18:30.230
That sounds like a knight.

00:18:30.730 --> 00:18:32.290
And, like his name suggests,

00:18:32.290 --> 00:18:34.630
he will come to your rescue if you're in trouble.

00:18:39.720 --> 00:18:41.890
Minami, let's get back to class.

00:18:42.640 --> 00:18:45.400
I'm going to stay here a little longer.

00:18:45.400 --> 00:18:46.740
Is that so?

00:18:46.740 --> 00:18:47.390
Yes.

00:18:47.850 --> 00:18:50.400
Thank you for the notes, I'll return them soon.

00:19:05.880 --> 00:19:08.160
I guess this is the right time.

00:19:11.130 --> 00:19:13.170
It was just like Minami said.

00:19:13.750 --> 00:19:15.650
A ghoul in the prefab house.

00:19:16.480 --> 00:19:17.670
Say, Arima.

00:19:18.840 --> 00:19:22.070
Aren't you being a bit hard on Minami?

00:19:23.040 --> 00:19:24.180
It's fine.

00:19:25.410 --> 00:19:27.570
Don't worry about Minami-san.

00:19:32.010 --> 00:19:36.150
How unusual for you to call me.

00:19:37.250 --> 00:19:40.770
Have you decided to hand over the 13th Ward to me,

00:19:40.770 --> 00:19:42.160
Pumpkin head?

00:19:42.730 --> 00:19:45.760
Are you aware that ghouls are being hunted here?

00:19:45.760 --> 00:19:46.830
Yeah.

00:19:47.300 --> 00:19:50.660
It was your binge eating that attracted the Doves.

00:19:51.020 --> 00:19:54.170
It's actually a team of three high school students.

00:19:54.600 --> 00:19:55.960
Students?

00:19:56.470 --> 00:19:58.130
They're not your average kids.

00:19:58.440 --> 00:20:01.480
If you take them lightly, even you might get hurt.

00:20:01.480 --> 00:20:05.070
They're just kids playing with toys.

00:20:06.070 --> 00:20:09.140
Kids play with toys better than adults.

00:20:09.730 --> 00:20:14.150
Did you call me here just to say that?

00:20:17.560 --> 00:20:20.210
A common enemy has emerged.

00:20:20.210 --> 00:20:22.570
How about we make a temporary truce?

00:20:24.430 --> 00:20:26.100
Putting on airs...

00:20:30.640 --> 00:20:31.510
Minami!

00:20:32.730 --> 00:20:33.960
Fura-kun!

00:20:34.640 --> 00:20:36.750
Your intel was spot on.

00:20:37.260 --> 00:20:38.490
That's good to hear.

00:20:38.490 --> 00:20:40.760
I'm glad I was able to help a little.

00:20:46.450 --> 00:20:50.770
Hey, about Arima... Do you...

00:20:52.120 --> 00:20:52.770
What is it?

00:20:53.890 --> 00:20:55.520
It's that man!

00:20:59.640 --> 00:21:00.400
Look!

00:21:01.150 --> 00:21:02.620
A ghoul?

00:21:02.620 --> 00:21:04.540
I'm not sure, but...

00:21:04.540 --> 00:21:05.910
Let's call Arima!

00:21:06.400 --> 00:21:07.400
Not yet!

00:21:07.400 --> 00:21:08.120
What's wrong!?

00:21:09.130 --> 00:21:10.080
We have to follow him!

00:21:10.850 --> 00:21:11.940
You're right.

00:21:14.390 --> 00:21:16.130
He came in here?

00:21:16.130 --> 00:21:17.000
Yes.

00:21:19.540 --> 00:21:20.800
What's wrong, Arima?

00:21:21.760 --> 00:21:23.070
Taishi, stay on the first floor.

00:21:23.070 --> 00:21:25.740
Minami-san and I will head up to the second floor.

00:21:25.740 --> 00:21:28.060
Stay close to me.

00:21:28.060 --> 00:21:29.300
O-Okay.

00:21:40.350 --> 00:21:41.970
Arima-kun.

00:21:41.970 --> 00:21:42.730
What?

00:21:43.570 --> 00:21:46.490
You know Arima-kun, you're something else.

00:21:47.890 --> 00:21:50.350
You're straightforward

00:21:50.350 --> 00:21:52.490
and you have the strength to press on to your goal.

00:21:53.220 --> 00:21:55.030
I don't think many can do that.

00:21:56.640 --> 00:21:57.810
So...

00:21:58.290 --> 00:22:02.540
This might sound strange coming at a time like this...

00:22:03.790 --> 00:22:06.010
I see... It's time.

00:22:06.580 --> 00:22:08.010
Arima-kun.

00:22:16.240 --> 00:22:17.480
Die.

00:22:31.870 --> 00:22:33.620
Arima-kun!

00:22:36.080 --> 00:22:40.420
You knew all along that I was a ghoul, didn't you!?

00:22:42.730 --> 00:22:45.600
Well, it doesn't matter.

00:22:45.600 --> 00:22:47.380
You see Arima-kun,

00:22:47.380 --> 00:22:49.730
this time I brought my friend,

00:22:49.730 --> 00:22:54.160
so if you don't hurry and rescue Fura-kun, he will die.

00:23:01.190 --> 00:23:04.400
I have to fight a little brat like you?

00:23:04.400 --> 00:23:07.030
You're not worth my time.

00:23:07.030 --> 00:23:08.440
The head or the feet,

00:23:08.440 --> 00:23:11.030
where should I begin my dinner?

00:23:11.030 --> 00:23:13.030
Make your decision!

00:23:14.540 --> 00:23:17.410
Are you in such a rush because you're worried about Fura-kun?

00:23:20.220 --> 00:23:21.580
I scratched you, I scratched you!

00:23:22.210 --> 00:23:24.520
Worried about your friend? How pathetic!

00:23:28.080 --> 00:23:30.340
Are you holding back on me?

00:23:30.660 --> 00:23:32.340
Don't you dare underestimate me!

00:24:05.130 --> 00:24:07.310
Sh-Shit...

00:24:17.330 --> 00:24:18.350
Minami!

00:24:19.670 --> 00:24:23.560
Arima! What's going on!? What did you do!?

00:24:23.560 --> 00:24:25.210
She's Lantern.

00:24:27.380 --> 00:24:30.010
What... did you say?

00:24:31.260 --> 00:24:33.200
I-It can't be!

00:24:34.570 --> 00:24:36.200
Minami!?

00:24:37.130 --> 00:24:40.520
I've always dreamed of

00:24:41.000 --> 00:24:42.710
being a normal girl.

00:24:44.330 --> 00:24:47.120
Spending time with friends... studying...

00:24:47.120 --> 00:24:49.710
I wanted to live like a human.

00:24:50.150 --> 00:24:52.720
Then why did you kill Ryou!?

00:24:53.360 --> 00:24:55.660
I loathe people like him.

00:24:56.690 --> 00:24:59.580
They don't even realize how lucky they are.

00:24:59.580 --> 00:25:01.350
They go through life acting like idiots,

00:25:01.850 --> 00:25:06.310
all the while with looks on their faces like, "I hate my life."

00:25:06.310 --> 00:25:07.860
That's your reason?

00:25:08.450 --> 00:25:11.160
They piss me off!

00:25:11.160 --> 00:25:12.950
That's why I killed him!

00:25:12.950 --> 00:25:15.360
Retards like that need to 
experience death to appreciate life!

00:25:17.470 --> 00:25:19.680
You're right. They're idiots.

00:25:20.420 --> 00:25:23.460
They cause trouble and hurt others.

00:25:23.460 --> 00:25:26.370
And they may have been the scum of society,

00:25:27.530 --> 00:25:28.880
but...

00:25:29.330 --> 00:25:30.380
but still...

00:25:32.570 --> 00:25:35.640
they meant the world to me!

00:25:36.220 --> 00:25:39.890
No matter how much you want to be a human, you will never be one!

00:25:40.440 --> 00:25:44.730
Someone who takes the lives of others with ease is not a human!

00:25:44.730 --> 00:25:46.390
How dare you...

00:25:46.640 --> 00:25:49.540
You don't even know what my life is like!

00:25:52.580 --> 00:25:54.610
Serves you right...

00:25:56.170 --> 00:25:57.360
Now you too...

00:25:58.820 --> 00:26:00.370
have taken a life.

00:26:06.210 --> 00:26:08.370
Exams are coming up soon.

00:26:10.080 --> 00:26:13.880
I studied so hard for them, too.

00:26:34.810 --> 00:26:35.940
<i>After what happened,</i>

00:26:36.610 --> 00:26:40.370
<i>Minami's body was sent to the CCG.</i>

00:26:41.390 --> 00:26:46.250
<i>Perhaps it was to avoid panic, but the school was never told what really happened.</i>

00:26:47.730 --> 00:26:50.370
<i>Arima transferred to another school.</i>

00:26:50.940 --> 00:26:55.270
<i>I hear he'll be working on a case that's left many other skilled investigators dead.</i>

00:26:56.190 --> 00:26:58.260
<i>And, like always,</i>

00:26:58.260 --> 00:27:02.760
<i>Arima said perhaps this would be the time he died.</i>

00:27:08.650 --> 00:27:11.430
Say, do you think all ghouls

00:27:11.430 --> 00:27:15.070
want to be human like Minami?

00:27:15.740 --> 00:27:19.490
Beats me. I don't usually talk to ghouls.

00:27:19.490 --> 00:27:24.080
No matter how much they wish for it,
 they can never become one. Must be rough.

00:27:25.060 --> 00:27:29.080
I think... I sort of understand how Minami felt.

00:27:35.900 --> 00:27:37.590
Ball help, please!

00:27:44.230 --> 00:27:45.840
Thank you!

00:27:47.630 --> 00:27:48.890
Hey, Arima.

00:27:49.840 --> 00:27:53.220
Everything I hold dear, I want to protect by myself.

00:27:54.410 --> 00:27:57.910
I'm gonna say something crazy, so tell me if it's possible or not.

00:27:59.230 --> 00:27:59.900
I want to...

00:28:05.990 --> 00:28:09.020
Fura-san! It seems our target has struck again.

00:28:09.020 --> 00:28:12.670
All right. Tell Iida and the others to continue monitoring him.

00:28:12.990 --> 00:28:13.930
Yes, sir.

00:28:14.470 --> 00:28:15.130
Senpai!

00:28:15.710 --> 00:28:19.520
Won't Aki-san be mad if you spend more time thinking about ghouls than her?

00:28:19.520 --> 00:28:23.090
Shut up. You know better than to bring my wife into work matters.

00:28:23.090 --> 00:28:24.720
Sorry, Boss.

00:28:25.260 --> 00:28:27.720
Special Investigator Arima, regarding the next case...

00:28:34.230 --> 00:28:36.900
Special Investigator Arima sure has an incredible aura, doesn't he?

00:28:38.350 --> 00:28:40.910
That idiot never changes.

00:28:40.910 --> 00:28:41.860
Huh?

00:28:41.860 --> 00:28:42.900
Nothing.

00:28:46.910 --> 00:28:49.410
All right! Let's go take out this ghoul

00:28:49.410 --> 00:28:52.160
so I can take my wife out for once!
